entries.definition_en:
A man of the tribe of Asher living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1Ch.7.36; 
 son of: Zophah (H6690); 
 brother of: Suah (H5477), Harnepher (H2774), Shual (H7777B), Beri (H1275), Bezer (H1221H), Hod (H1936), Shamma (H8037H), Shilshah (H8030), Ithran (H3506H) and Beera (H0878) 
 § Imrah = "bitterness"
 a descendant of Asher of the family of Zophah and a chief of the tribe

A man of the tribe of Judah(?) living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1Ch.4.17; 
 son of: Mered (H4778) and Bithiah (H1332); 
 brother of: Miriam (H4813H) and Shammai (H8060I); 
 half-brother of: Jered (H3382H)(?), Heber (H2268I)(?) and Jekuthiel (H3354)(?); married to Hodiah (H1940)(?); 
 father of: son_of_Hodiah (H3431H)(?) 
 § Ishbah = "he will praise"
 father of Eshtemoa and descendant of Judah

A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 1Ch.2.37; 
 son of: Zabad (H2066); 
 father of: Obed (H5744H) 
 § Ephlal = "intercessor"
 a descendant of Pharez
